1
00:00:04,120 --> 00:00:04,928
Kalau ribut,

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:06,979
Qian dapat alasan.

3
00:00:07,087 --> 00:00:08,674
Airnya dibendung semua!

4
00:00:08,844 --> 00:00:09,796
Qin Shuang benar.

5
00:00:10,108 --> 00:00:10,638
Air,

6
00:00:10,963 --> 00:00:12,100
kita cari sendiri.

7
00:00:14,908 --> 00:00:16,663
Kolam dalamnya masih ada air!

8
00:00:17,256 --> 00:00:18,296
Airnya di bawah,

9
00:00:18,361 --> 00:00:18,880
sawahnya di atas,

10
00:00:19,373 --> 00:00:20,534
nggak terangkut.

11
00:00:20,742 --> 00:00:22,347
Ngomong yang jelas.

12
00:00:22,413 --> 00:00:23,026
Gali sumur.

13
00:00:23,159 --> 00:00:23,922
Gali di sawah,

14
00:00:24,192 --> 00:00:25,795
sampai ketemu air.

15
00:00:28,343 --> 00:00:30,007
Hari ketiga,

16
00:00:30,257 --> 00:00:33,552
nggak satu sumur pun berair.

17
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:35,020
Kakek Han, istirahat saja.

18
00:00:35,283 --> 00:00:36,866
Kak Xu, biar aku!

19
00:00:36,943 --> 00:00:38,626
Erniu, giliranku.

20
00:00:40,245 --> 00:00:41,730
Sudah berapa lama dia di bawah?

21
00:00:42,362 --> 00:00:44,145
Seharian penuh.

22
00:00:44,212 --> 00:00:44,889
Tarik.

23
00:00:47,812 --> 00:00:49,519
Nggak… nggak ada air.

24
00:00:51,154 --> 00:00:52,435
Minggir semua.

25
00:00:54,902 --> 00:00:56,408
Pelajar ringkih,

26
00:00:56,653 --> 00:00:57,825
sok kuat,

27
00:00:57,998 --> 00:00:59,331
sok gali sumur.

28
00:00:59,828 --> 00:01:02,934
Qin Shuang, poin suka empat puluh satu.

29
00:01:03,016 --> 00:01:04,878
Peti hadiah terbuka:

30
00:01:04,948 --> 00:01:07,063
gambar kincir air.

31
00:01:07,132 --> 00:01:09,075
Pak Shi, kincir ini bisa dibuat?

32
00:01:09,551 --> 00:01:11,013
Gambarnya bagus.

33
00:01:11,079 --> 00:01:13,041
Seratus lima puluh kilo kayu bagus,

34
00:01:13,135 --> 00:01:14,684
di desa ini cari di mana?

35
00:01:14,764 --> 00:01:17,249
Pohon besar habis ditebang tahun lalu.

36
00:01:17,701 --> 00:01:19,108
Kayu sebesar itu,

37
00:01:19,172 --> 00:01:21,110
di desa cuma sisa satu.

38
00:01:21,183 --> 00:01:22,180
Balok rumah leluhur.

39
00:01:22,787 --> 00:01:25,180
Leluhur, saksikanlah.

40
00:01:25,254 --> 00:01:27,622
Lepas balok rumah leluhur,

41
00:01:27,697 --> 00:01:30,794
demi seteguk air buat anak-anak.

42
00:01:32,686 --> 00:01:34,426
Sarjana Xu, kau putuskan.
